  "event_seq": 99,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets roughly doubled from a ~600/month baseline to ~1200/month in Aug-Sep 2026 (E-05); the majority of disputed bills are tied to ACTUAL meter reads rather than estimated ones (E-02), which rules out tariff change (E-03) and response-speed/SLA issues (E-04) as causes. This points to an error introduced during billing import/validation of accepted reads (H-BILLING-RULE-CHANGE) as the best-supported remaining mechanism, rather than estimate-substitution from field route delays, though a specific rule-change event correlated with the August onset is not yet directly confirmed via the billing-config rule-change log (DA-RULES)."
